# L §7.1: "Division by zero is refused at that key (RUN-DIV)"; "There is no floating point anywhere": 1 / 3 is the
# exact 1/3 (printed a/b with a 15-digit display, L §5.18).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input three: int
input zero: int

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  three = 3
  zero = 0

ask q1: 1 / three
ask q2: 1 / zero
=== expect
q1: 1/3 (0.333333333333333)
  cut 2026-12-31
q2: refused: RUN-DIV ...
  cut 2026-12-31
